{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（癸未、七四三）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（癸未、七四三）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf6a-db0e-11ef-ac8d-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":703,"link_death_year":757,"link_td_description":"安禄山，营州柳城（今辽宁省朝阳市）人，本姓康，名轧荦山。父为昭武九姓的粟特人，母为突厥巫师，信仰祆教。是唐代藩镇割据势力之一的最初建立者，也是安史之乱的主要发动人之一，后建立大燕政权，自称雄武皇帝，年号圣武。","link_td_id":"Q10000104","link_td_number_id":64765,"people_name":"安祿山","people_name_jianti_auto":"安禄山","people_xingming":"安禄山","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf6f-db0e-11ef-933c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":703,"link_death_year":757,"link_td_description":"安禄山，营州柳城（今辽宁省朝阳市）人，本姓康，名轧荦山。父为昭武九姓的粟特人，母为突厥巫师，信仰祆教。是唐代藩镇割据势力之一的最初建立者，也是安史之乱的主要发动人之一，后建立大燕政权，自称雄武皇帝，年号圣武。","link_td_id":"Q10000104","link_td_number_id":64765,"people_name":"祿山","people_name_jianti_auto":"禄山","people_xingming":"安禄山","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf70-db0e-11ef-bfa6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"營州","place_name_jianti_auto":"营州","place_note":"辽宁朝阳","resolved_place_entity_id":710,"start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf71-db0e-11ef-8388-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，正月，安祿山入朝；上寵待甚厚，謁見無時。祿山奏言：「去年營州蟲食苗，臣焚香祝天云：『臣若操心不正，事君不忠，願使蟲食臣心；若不負神祇，願使蟲散。』卽有羣鳥從北來，食蟲立盡。請宣付史官。」從之。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，安禄山入京朝见玄宗；玄宗对他宠待非常优厚，允许他随时进见。安禄山上奏说：“去年营州害虫吃禾苗，臣焚香向天祈祷说：‘臣若心术不正，侍奉国君不忠，愿让害虫吃掉臣的心；若没有辜负天地神灵，愿让害虫散去。’随即有一群鸟从北方飞来，很快把害虫吃光了。请皇上宣示此事并交付史官记载。”玄宗听从了。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，安禄山入朝；上宠待甚厚，谒见无时。禄山奏言：「去年营州虫食苗，臣焚香祝天云：『臣若操心不正，事君不忠，愿使虫食臣心；若不负神祇，愿使虫散。』即有群鸟从北来，食虫立尽。请宣付史官。」从之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21705,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf6b-db0e-11ef-9c55-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"政府，謂政事堂。","note_content_jianti_auto":"政府，谓政事堂。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf73-db0e-11ef-ac76-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"薊縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓟县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf76-db0e-11ef-8e2c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幽州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幽州","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf77-db0e-11ef-b308-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涿郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"涿郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf78-db0e-11ef-a686-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涿郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"涿郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf79-db0e-11ef-ac77-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"范陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"范阳郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf7a-db0e-11ef-bab3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薊縣帶幽州涿郡，時改涿郡爲范陽郡。薊，音計。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蓟县带幽州涿郡，时改涿郡为范阳郡。蓟，音计。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf75-db0e-11ef-98ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"