bd68cf72-db0e-11ef-99a8-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yùn","source_anchor_text":"薊令蘇孝韞以告安祿","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":82,"text":"韞","tongjian_id":"26ff1813-d783-5893-aef3-4780a1ad6220"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bd68cf72-db0e-11ef-99a8-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"fěi","source_anchor_text":"部郎中裴朏等皆貶嶺","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":162,"text":"朏","tongjian_id":"5be248b9-cc8c-5454-b5c1-848ddd60424b"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"薊","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓟","place_note":"范阳郡郡政府所在县•北京市","resolved_place_entity_id":478,"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1aee-db0e-11ef-b5b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武當","place_name_jianti_auto":"武当","place_note":"湖北丹江口西北","resolved_place_entity_id":2297,"start_index":133,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1af4-db0e-11ef-b643-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安康","place_name_jianti_auto":"安康","place_note":"陕西安康","resolved_place_entity_id":3682,"start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1af5-db0e-11ef-b9ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮阳","place_note":"河南淮阳","resolved_place_entity_id":723,"start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1af6-db0e-11ef-9fc6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"嶺南","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭南","resolved_place_entity_id":326,"start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1af9-db0e-11ef-ba8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壺關","place_name_jianti_auto":"壶关","place_note":"山西壶关","resolved_place_entity_id":1181,"start_index":173,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1afa-db0e-11ef-82f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"2李林甫領吏部尚書，日在政府，選事悉委侍郞宋遙、苗晉卿。御史中丞張倚新得幸於上，遙、晉卿欲附之。時選人集者以萬計，入等者六十四人，倚子奭爲之首，羣議沸騰。前薊令蘇孝韞以告安祿山，祿山入言於上，上悉召入等人面試之，奭手持試紙，終日不成一字，時人謂之「曳白」。癸亥，遙貶武當太守，晉卿貶安康太守，倚貶淮陽太守，同考判官禮部郞中裴朏等皆貶嶺南官。晉卿，壺關人也。","content_fanyi":"李林甫兼任吏部尚书，每天在政事堂办公，把选举事务全部委托给侍郎宋遥、苗晋卿。御史中丞张倚新近得到玄宗的宠幸，宋遥、苗晋卿想依附他。当时候选人聚集的数以万计，因文理优长被录取的有六十四人，张倚的儿子张奭位居第一，众人议论沸腾。前任蓟县县令苏孝韫把这事告知安禄山，安禄山入宫向玄宗奏报，玄宗将被录取者全部召来当面考试，张奭手拿试卷，整整一天写不出一个字，当时人称他为“曳白”。正月二十三日癸亥，宋遥被贬为武当太守，苗晋卿被贬为安康太守，张倚被贬为淮阳太守，同考判官、礼部郎中裴朏等人都被贬为岭南官。苗晋卿是壶关人。","content_jianti_auto":"2李林甫领吏部尚书，日在政府，选事悉委侍郞宋遥、苗晋卿。御史中丞张倚新得幸于上，遥、晋卿欲附之。时选人集者以万计，入等者六十四人，倚子奭为之首，群议沸腾。前蓟令苏孝韫以告安禄山，禄山入言于上，上悉召入等人面试之，奭手持试纸，终日不成一字，时人谓之「曳白」。癸亥，遥贬武当太守，晋卿贬安康太守，倚贬淮阳太守，同考判官礼部郞中裴朏等皆贬岭南官。晋卿，壶关人也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21706,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd68cf72-db0e-11ef-99a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"唐","people_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1afd-db0e-11ef-881e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虞","people_name_jianti_auto":"虞","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1afe-db0e-11ef-b241-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"皋陶","people_name_jianti_auto":"皋陶","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1aff-db0e-11ef-a26f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"李氏","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b00-db0e-11ef-9941-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"德明皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"德明皇帝","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b01-db0e-11ef-8fdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"涼武昭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"凉武昭王","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b02-db0e-11ef-90d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b03-db0e-11ef-b39c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"李氏","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b04-db0e-11ef-b4ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"興聖皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"兴圣皇帝","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b05-db0e-11ef-8437-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bd6b1b06-db0e-11ef-a63b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瓜","pl